      <marc:subfield code="a">The text is a description of Wang Tao&apos;s contribution to evangelical and religious poetry within the contemporary Malaysian Chinese literary scene. His work aims to bear witness to God&apos;s love and glory through his life experiences, insights, and the marvelous works of God in the church and overall. Wang Tao&apos;s writing highlights a theological stance, focusing on divine matters rather than worldly or literary concerns, encouraging readers to ponder spiritual truths.</marc:subfield>
